This is "library", this driver's own bundled mudlib -- a stripped-down
rebuild of Lil (a real third-party minimal starter mudlib) down to just
the driver-required boot plumbing, one starting room, and the wand of
creation.

Login, look around the entrance hall, and you already have a wand of
creation in hand. Try: clone <path>, purge <id>, create <name>.

Stock Lil itself, unmodified, is preserved at temp/lil/ (gitignored,
cited but never edited going forward) -- that is where the real efun/
compiler conformance suite Lil used to ship (single/tests/) now lives,
along with everything else this rebuild dropped. See
LIBRARY_MUDLIB_PLAN.md in this directory for the full before/after
accounting of what moved, what stayed, and why.
